    {
      "id": "chapter02",
      "t": "微服務拆分策略與邊界設計",
      "en": "Microservices Decomposition & Boundary Design",
      "description": "結合 DDD（領域驅動設計）與 Strangler Fig 模式，學習如何正確拆解單體架構。重點在於定義服務邊界（Boundaries）以避免分散式單體（Distributed Monolith）的陷阱。",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
        "data": "github/md",
        "dataLocation": "https://github.com/feelryan/jujuen/blob/skills/cloud-native-architecture/chapter02.md"
      }
    },
