    {
      "id": "chapter03",
      "t": "容器設計模式與 Kubernetes 原語",
      "en": "Container Design Patterns & Kubernetes Primitives",
      "description": "深入 Sidecar、Ambassador、Adapter 等容器設計模式，並掌握 Kubernetes 核心資源（Pod, Deployment, StatefulSet）在生產環境中的最佳配置與資源管理。",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
