    {
      "id": "chapter04",
      "t": "服務通訊與 Service Mesh",
      "en": "Service Communication & Service Mesh",
      "description": "比較 REST、gRPC 與 GraphQL 的適用場景，探討 Service Mesh（如 Istio, Linkerd）解決的流量管理、mTLS 與重試問題，以及何時該引入 Mesh 層。",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
