    {
      "id": "chapter05",
      "t": "事件驅動架構與非同步處理",
      "en": "Event-Driven Architecture (EDA) & Asynchrony",
      "description": "利用 Message Queue（Kafka, RabbitMQ）解耦系統，設計 Event Sourcing 與 Pub/Sub 模型。這是解決高併發與削峰填谷（Load Leveling）的關鍵架構。",
